      "writtenOn": "2017-08-17T03:14:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The term \"ccd\" is now overloaded to mean any debugging with the case closed - whether it\u0027s done via a USB-C debug accessory or cr50tool running from a root shell.  \"rdd\" means \"remote debug device\" - that is, a USB-C debug accessory.  Which is what CCD_MODE_L connects.\n\nI\u0027m open to suggestions for better names, but we should decide soon since we\u0027ll make Nick sad if we keep changing them...",
